    family_one is a set.
    family_two is a set.
    Bob belongs to family_one.
    Alice belongs to family_one.
    Alice belongs to family_two.
    query_1 expects answers ["family_one is a subset of family_one", "family_two is a subset of family_one", "family_two is a subset of family_two"].

query query_1 is:
